# Paths agents may not edit, in every state (bash glob syntax, relative to the repo root).
# Format: <glob> <reason...>. Extend per repo in .aiops/config/protected-paths. Read by hooks/guard-files.sh.
.env* secrets/env files
*/.env* secrets/env files
secrets/* secret material
*.pem secret material
*.key secret material
*id_rsa* secret material
.git/* git internals
package-lock.json lockfiles are changed by the package manager, not by hand
yarn.lock lockfiles are changed by the package manager, not by hand
pnpm-lock.yaml lockfiles are changed by the package manager, not by hand
poetry.lock lockfiles are changed by the package manager, not by hand
uv.lock lockfiles are changed by the package manager, not by hand
Cargo.lock lockfiles are changed by the package manager, not by hand
go.sum lockfiles are changed by the package manager, not by hand
.aiops/config* guardrails are human-owned; propose the change in chat
.aiops/state/* engine state; changed only through the sdlc CLI and hooks
.claude/settings.json guardrails are human-owned; propose the change in chat
governance/* org policy is human-owned
.github/workflows/deploy.yml production gate is human-owned
.github/workflows/aiops-gates.yml gate audit is human-owned
